  "title": "Nopalitos con Papas (Cactus with Potatoes)",
  "description": "Nopalito con papas is a Mexican-inspired side dish featuring cactus and potatoes with tomatoes, onion, and jalapeños. Cactus tastes like cooked green beans.",
